waitlog verb=tickwarp end=\S+ ticks=500 60
> cdevtest be 308 -59 310
> cdevtest state 312 -60 310
> cdevtest be 312 -59 310
expect verb=state pos=312,-60,310 state="\S*lit=false
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0
look skillet: the beef placed by the bot ("use" line SUCCESS/CONSUME), cooking progress 0 in the unlit be line, rising after BurnTime (cooked beef or progress > 0 after 160 ticks); keg: temperature tag (numeric list) higher while lit than before; after the burn ran out (660 ticks) the oven lit=false (checked). If the keg has no temperature field in its NBT, mark not judged (client WTHIT)

